<!--
license:CC0-1.0
copyright-holders:superctr

The JD-990 front panel.  The display is the 320 x 80 dot module behind its cover; every key of
the right-hand block has a lamp, but the driver has no LED outputs yet, so none is placed.
PERFORM is drawn without an input: the key matrix position that changes the mode is not known.
Coordinates are tenths of a millimetre on the 482 x 88.1 mm plate.
-->
